/-!
# R003 — every direct power of `A₅` satisfies Herzog–Schönheim

The index-monoid criterion: the subgroup indices of `G` lie in the multiplicative monoid
generated by the indices of `A₅`, and the reciprocal mass of that monoid below `2` never
reaches `1`, so the Garonzi–Margolis criterion applies.

Canonical website page: <https://stepsunbounded.com/results/R003/>.
-/
